- Variance aggregation: Group features with high variance (e.g., F03[C-O], nCb-, SdO) using a sum or nonlinear transform:
  - Formula: high_variance_sum = F03[C-O] + nCb- + SdO.

### 5. Binary Presence/Absence Indicators
- Halogen presence interaction: Combine B01[C-Br], B03[C-Cl], and B04[C-Br] into a single binary indicator of halogen presence:
  - Formula: halogen_bond_presence = max(B01[C-Br], B03[C-Cl], B04[C-Br]).

